{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_005yay0373_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_005yay0373_1000_p", "source_sha256": "c3ac4f4e19d10f2a238dfcb11e8544dd805102b1e94e1febe84e724463c09ae1", "ja": "（年末特番の収録が終わり、しばらく経った。\n劇場にも、年の瀬のしんとした空気が漂っている……）", "zh": "（年末特别节目的录制结束后，过了一段时间。\n剧场里也弥漫着年关将至的寂静气氛……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_005yay0373_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_005yay0373_1001_005yay", "source_sha256": "f5a212e136df49e12d558b6aad0207cc5e9ba21d8a21285cef16835b6081a7a2", "ja": "{$P$}、お疲れさまです！\n聞いてください、大発見ですよ！", "zh": "{$P$}，辛苦了！\n快听我说，我有重大发现哦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_005yay0373_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_005yay0373_1002_p", "source_sha256": "2141faafb95a6116e459e596e6a15fc43ef29855e787e4390c3695e417956bad", "ja": "おっ、やよい、どうしたんだ？", "zh": "哦，弥生，怎么了？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_005yay0373_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_005yay0373_1003_005yay", "source_sha256": "510316a4d240b5ba649627552f36cf55d222cf83c8650fe2a0648a840e5c3326", "ja": "{$P$}、知ってますか？\n野菜に話しかけると、よく育つって。", "zh": "{$P$}，您知道吗？\n据说和蔬菜说话的话，蔬菜就会长得更好。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_005yay0373_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_005yay0373_1004_005yay", "source_sha256": "58aecd4fe76d1be7bea4a5ccb562bb1fde20eeae5b5e6c459a7c670eb207a792", "ja": "それで私、いつもうちの家庭菜園の野菜たちと\n話すようにしてるんです！", "zh": "所以，我一直都会和家里的菜园里的蔬菜们聊天！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_005yay0373_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_005yay0373_1005_005yay", "source_sha256": "bcef43637e7817ea63a5abf276ba337a4909bd6805ec43956723aca4b06c9bfc", "ja": "挨拶とか、近況報告とか……。\nたまに、お仕事の話とかもしてるんですよ。", "zh": "打招呼啦，聊聊近况什么的……有时候也会和它们说说工作的事哦。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_005yay0373_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_005yay0373_1006_p", "source_sha256": "f57e2dc73f913b6d4dc9270009ac2d468c760e24d3a7008b5029c72bf853a63c", "ja": "へえ、仲良しみたいだな。\nそれで、大発見っていうのは？", "zh": "哦，关系真好啊。\n所以，你说的重大发现是什么？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_005yay0373_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_005yay0373_1007_005yay", "source_sha256": "d772aaeedb36f3bf8bc7fdf787aabf986357a78ecaf9ceebd24fa9630be11491", "ja": "はい！　私、最近、年末特番のお仕事で、\nギャル語の勉強をしたじゃないですか？", "zh": "是的！我最近不是为了年末特别节目，学习了辣妹用语吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_005yay0373_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_005yay0373_1008_005yay", "source_sha256": "1fa059464ef2e9c2ccd20e468d96b51fb996e0b47812f78be5d164b3a20bc9d9", "ja": "せっかくだからと思って、野菜たちに、\nずっとギャル語で話しかけるようにしてみたんですよ。", "zh": "难得有这个机会，我就想着试试看，一直用辣妹语和蔬菜们说话。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_005yay0373_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_005yay0373_1009_005yay", "source_sha256": "659df4dd8cdcb79303ae0720342c1458a1b468da90cc3cf5e3067569a9c7cef1", "ja": "ほうれん草マジぎゃんかわっしょ～！\nとか、カブしか勝たん！　とか……。", "zh": "比如“菠菜真的超可爱～！”、“萝卜才是最棒的！”之类的……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_005yay0373_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_005yay0373_1010_005yay", "source_sha256": "4595d325b4a596de6013246fb548611c350b0af0931a3bf85315d10ca351a4cd", "ja": "そうしたら、なんだか野菜たちが、\nとってもかわちいになってきた気がするんです！", "zh": "这样一来，总觉得蔬菜们都变得特别可爱了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_005yay0373_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_005yay0373_1011_p", "source_sha256": "72745b37f1c0bcb2f4af8fa91104879d6ae8b905783acaf5e47c28fc9fa04514", "ja": "野菜たちが、かわちいに……？", "zh": "蔬菜们变得可爱了……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_005yay0373_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_005yay0373_1012_005yay", "source_sha256": "7ec1bcf329949eb9d4605480ac3ca34c4540cdbce042e81088d768f048629723", "ja": "はい！　色とか形とかが、なんとなく変わってきて。\nあっ、後で写真送りますね。", "zh": "好的！颜色、形状之类的，感觉都渐渐发生变化了。\n啊，之后我把照片发给你。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_005yay0373_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_005yay0373_1013_005yay", "source_sha256": "a5defbdba23ee472cf21c4ee97a6e456c9ca43b6c29ce6eae49347ada8e5c3a3", "ja": "野菜も、褒められると可愛くなるんですね！\nうっうー！　みんなの成長が楽しみですー！", "zh": "蔬菜被夸奖了，也会变得可爱呢！嗯嗯——！好期待大家的成长哦——！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_005yay0373_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_005yay0373_1014_p", "source_sha256": "8b4d12225f5c102012a37701bc28e7285b754718e5f1a6af810dd5900f49651b", "ja": "（ギャル語で育った野菜、か……。\nどんな味がするのか、ちょっと興味があるな！）", "zh": "（用辣妹语培育出来的蔬菜吗……\n真有点好奇会是什么味道啊！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
